//　どんな速度で飛ばされたのだ）
(We don't appear to be falling. Does that mean we've escaped Earth's gravity? How fast were we going, exactly?)

pt:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md05/0220040a00'>
//（あの方向へ<RUBY text='・・・'>落ちて</RUBY>いかない……という事は
